🚨🏈 BIG NEWS FOR RAE’SHAWN CLYDE! 🏈🚨

From Randolph-Clay High School to GPB Sports!

Congratulations to Rae’shawn Clyde, Class of 2027, on being selected as a GPB Sports "Make That Kid an Offer" nominee!

The hard work, dedication, versatility, academic excellence, and determination are getting noticed!

Over 2,500 all-purpose yards, 36 total touchdowns, a 3.9 GPA, and a commitment to excellence both on and off the field.

The journey isn't over. The goal remains the same. Keep working, keep believing, and keep making them notice!

